  "Name": "Dance Central 2",
  "Overview": "The core gameplay in Dance Central 2 is mostly identical to the original Dance Central. Players perform given dance moves, which are tracked by the Kinect. The more accurately the player performs the move, the more points he/she scores. Higher difficulties increase move complexity, and the margin for error is reduced.\nFeatures new to Dance Central 2 include voice control, simultaneous two player gameplay in both cooperative and competitive modes with drop in/drop out functionality, an improved fitness mode, a more in-depth and customizable \"Break it Down\" mode, allowing the player to practice only specific moves in a routine, and a campaign mode featuring dance crews of various styles.",
